        "subject": "=🌟 See you tomorrow! {{ $json.service }} — {{ $json.apptTime }}",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html><html><body style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;color:#333;\">\n<div style=\"background:#9333ea;color:white;padding:24px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0;\">🌟 See You Tomorrow!</h2></div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdf4ff;padding:24px;border:1px solid #f0abfc;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;\">\n  <p>Hi {{ $json.clientName }},</p>\n  <p>Your <strong>{{ $json.service }}</strong> appointment is <strong>tomorrow</strong> — we're looking forward to it!</p>\n  <div style=\"background:white;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;margin:20px 0;border-left:4px solid #9333ea;\">\n    🕐 <strong>{{ $json.apptTime }}</strong> tomorrow, {{ $json.apptDate }}<br/>\n    ✨ Service: {{ $json.service }}<br/>\n    👤 Provider: {{ $json.provider }}\n  </div>\n  <p>If anything comes up and you need to reschedule, please reply ASAP — this helps us offer your slot to someone on our waitlist. We appreciate the notice!</p>\n  <p>See you tomorrow!<br/><strong>YOUR_CLINIC_NAME</strong></p>\n</div>\n</body></html>",
