    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.clientEmail }}",
        "subject": "=We missed you today, {{ $json.clientName }} — let's reschedule",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html><html><body style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;color:#333;\">\n<div style=\"background:#dc2626;color:white;padding:24px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0;\">We Missed You Today</h2></div>\n<div style=\"background:#fff5f5;padding:24px;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;\">\n  <p>Hi {{ $json.clientName }},</p>\n  <p>We noticed you weren't able to make your <strong>{{ $json.service }}</strong> appointment today. We hope everything is okay!</p>\n  <p>Life gets busy — we completely understand. Your goal is still achievable and we'd love to help you get there.</p>\n  <div style=\"background:white;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;margin:20px 0;text-align:center;border:1px solid #fecaca;\">\n    <strong>Ready to rebook?</strong><br/>\n    <a href=\"mailto:YOUR_CLINIC_EMAIL@gmail.com\" style=\"background:#be185d;color:white;padding:10px 24px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;\">Reply to Reschedule →</a>\n  </div>\n  <p>If there's anything that put you off — concerns about the treatment, pricing, or anything else — please just reply. I'm happy to answer any questions honestly.</p>\n  <p>Hope to see you soon!<br/><strong>YOUR_CLINIC_NAME</strong></p>\n</div>\n</body></html>",
