        "subject": "=Still thinking about {{ $json.service }}, {{ $json.clientName }}?",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html><html><body style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;color:#333;\">\n<div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#be185d,#9333ea);color:white;padding:24px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0;\">✨ Just Checking In</h2></div>\n<div style=\"background:#fdf4ff;padding:24px;border:1px solid #f0abfc;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;\">\n  <p>Hi {{ $json.clientName }},</p>\n  <p>It's been a few days since you reached out about <strong>{{ $json.service }}</strong>. I just wanted to check in and see if you had any questions or were ready to book.</p>\n  <p>Completely no pressure — I just want to make sure you have everything you need to feel confident about taking the next step.</p>\n  <div style=\"background:white;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;margin:20px 0;border-left:4px solid #be185d;\">\n    <strong>What most people ask before booking:</strong><br/><br/>\n    ❓ <em>\"Does it hurt?\"</em> — Most clients describe a mild pinch or pressure. Pain is minimal and temporary.<br/><br/>\n    ❓ <em>\"How long until I see results?\"</em> — Depends on the treatment, but most see results within a few days to 2 weeks.<br/><br/>\n    ❓ <em>\"What's the downtime?\"</em> — Most of our treatments have zero to minimal downtime.\n  </div>\n  <p>If you have a different question, just reply to this email. I personally respond to every message.</p>\n  <a href=\"mailto:YOUR_CLINIC_EMAIL@gmail.com\" style=\"background:#be185d;color:white;padding:10px 24px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;display:inline-block;\">Book a Free Consultation →</a>\n  <p style=\"margin-top:20px;\">Looking forward to helping you reach your goals!<br/><strong>YOUR_CLINIC_NAME</strong></p>\n</div>\n</body></html>",
        "options": {}
