    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $json.clientEmail }}",
        "subject": "=How are you feeling after your {{ $json.service }} yesterday?",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html><html><body style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;color:#333;\">\n<div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#059669,#0891b2);color:white;padding:24px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0;\">💚 Post-Treatment Check-In</h2></div>\n<div style=\"background:#f0fdf4;padding:24px;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;\">\n  <p>Hi {{ $json.clientName }},</p>\n  <p>How are you feeling after your <strong>{{ $json.service }}</strong> yesterday? I hope you're already loving the results!</p>\n  <div style=\"background:white;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;margin:20px 0;border-left:4px solid #059669;\">\n    <strong>A few aftercare reminders:</strong><br/><br/>\n    ✅ Stay hydrated — drink plenty of water today<br/>\n    ✅ Avoid strenuous exercise for 24 hours<br/>\n    ✅ Avoid touching or rubbing the treated area<br/>\n    ✅ If you experience any unexpected reactions, contact us immediately\n  </div>\n  <p>If you have any questions or anything feels off, just reply to this email — I'm always here.</p>\n  <p>We'd also love to see you for your next visit when you're ready. Reply \"book\" and we'll find a time that works for you.</p>\n  <p>Thank you for trusting us with your care!<br/><strong>{{ $json.provider }} &amp; the team at YOUR_CLINIC_NAME</strong></p>\n</div>\n</body></html>",
        "options": {}
